1
00:00:59,759 --> 00:01:02,799
Poor Third Madam was so devoted to Master in life.

2
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:04,280
And since her death,

3
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:06,680
she comes back to find Master every night.

4
00:01:06,879 --> 00:01:07,519
Master.

5
00:01:08,079 --> 00:01:09,040
You're back.

6
00:01:17,280 --> 00:01:17,680
Come on.

7
00:01:19,319 --> 00:01:20,560
Let's go check out the Dragon-Locking Well.

8
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:25,359
Wait for me!

9
00:01:28,879 --> 00:01:29,799
This day

10
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:31,719
has finally come.

11
00:02:01,519 --> 00:02:02,120
Third Madam.

12
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:04,200
You loved singing opera.

13
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:14,240
The last opera you sang before you died

14
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:16,120
was Cinnabar Well.

15
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:22,759
While you were singing,

16
00:02:23,439 --> 00:02:24,479
you disturbed the Dragon King.

17
00:02:25,840 --> 00:02:27,599
So, did you really see the Dragon King?

18
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:50,560
Why does it smell like rotten eggs?

19
00:02:51,199 --> 00:02:52,080
I smell it too.

20
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:54,240
That's the smell of miasma.

21
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:56,759
Miasma?

22
00:02:57,759 --> 00:02:59,159
Is your dog nose working right?

23
00:03:00,039 --> 00:03:02,120
It's only found in deep mountain swamps.

24
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:03,360
This is the Li Mansion.

25
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:05,080
Never mind the swamps.

26
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:06,240
There are barely any trees here.

27
00:03:06,599 --> 00:03:07,520
Where would miasma come from?

28
00:03:08,719 --> 00:03:09,800
In mountain forests during summer,

29
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:11,520
the temperature and humidity are high.

30
00:03:12,199 --> 00:03:13,960
The miasma in the mountains is very thick.

31
00:03:15,199 --> 00:03:16,919
Once a person inhales miasma,

32
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:19,120
they'll at least fall ill,

33
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:21,159
or at worst, die.

34
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:23,400
Are you saying

35
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:25,599
Third Madam didn't die from possession?

36
00:03:26,080 --> 00:03:27,319
She died from inhaling miasma?

37
00:03:27,919 --> 00:03:28,400
Exactly.

38
00:03:30,319 --> 00:03:31,680
Miasma causes fever,

39
00:03:32,159 --> 00:03:33,159
chills, and other symptoms.

40
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:35,439
When the virus invades the nervous system,

41
00:03:35,919 --> 00:03:37,120
it also causes delirium.

42
00:03:38,319 --> 00:03:39,680
Third Madam's so-called possession

43
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:41,759
was actually miasma poisoning.

44
00:03:42,199 --> 00:03:42,639
Then...

45
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:44,960
Then this Dragon-Locking Well...

46
00:03:45,599 --> 00:03:46,639
Iron chains locking the Dragon King...

47
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:48,120
Where's the Dragon King?

48
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:49,759
And this miasma...

49
00:03:49,919 --> 00:03:50,680
Where did it come from?

50
00:03:52,039 --> 00:03:53,520
Since you have so many questions,

51
00:03:54,199 --> 00:03:55,840
why not go ask the Dragon King yourself?

52
00:03:56,319 --> 00:03:57,439
Why me?

53
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:58,479
Why not you?

54
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:00,319
Master!

55
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:01,080
Master!

56
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:02,439
My Master can't swim!

57
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:03,439
Quick, save him!

58
00:04:04,639 --> 00:04:05,560
Why didn't you say so sooner?

59
00:04:10,599 --> 00:04:11,520
Pull him up quickly!

60
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:15,520
Master! Wake up!

61
00:04:15,599 --> 00:04:16,199
Don't scare me!

62
00:04:16,639 --> 00:04:17,160
Bookworm!

63
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:18,519
Bookworm!

64
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:19,759
Master! Bookworm!

65
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:20,879
Wake up!

66
00:04:21,399 --> 00:04:22,000
Bookworm!

67
00:04:22,519 --> 00:04:23,040
Is he okay?

68
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:23,519
Master!

69
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:24,160
Wake up!

70
00:04:24,319 --> 00:04:25,879
Master! Wake up! Master!

71
00:04:26,079 --> 00:04:28,680
I won't fight you for chicken legs again!

72
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:31,279
Master! Wake up!

73
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:33,360
Master!

74
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:34,759
Master!

75
00:04:36,759 --> 00:04:37,279
What are you doing?

76
00:04:37,959 --> 00:04:38,399
You do it.

77
00:04:39,160 --> 00:04:40,120
You'd better do it.

78
00:04:40,279 --> 00:04:41,279
I have bad breath.

79
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:44,160
Master!

80
00:04:50,639 --> 00:04:51,040
Dad!

81
00:04:53,399 --> 00:04:54,480
It's so good to see you.

82
00:04:55,160 --> 00:04:55,879
What's so good about it?

83
00:04:57,279 --> 00:04:57,759
Let me ask you.

84
00:04:58,279 --> 00:05:00,600
Where is Heavenly Craftsmanship from Wenchang Pavilion?

85
00:05:03,279 --> 00:05:05,319
Thieves stole Heavenly Craftsmanship.

86
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:06,720
Where is the book now?

87
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:07,360
I have no idea.

88
00:05:08,399 --> 00:05:09,480
Didn't I tell you?

89
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:11,560
Guard the book with your life.

90
00:05:12,519 --> 00:05:13,720
And you still have the nerve to come back?

91
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:15,439
Go!

92
00:05:15,839 --> 00:05:16,759
Hurry up and get the book back!

93
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:18,639
If you can't find Heavenly Craftsmanship,

94
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:20,360
then never come back!

95
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:24,240
Master!

96
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:25,240
Master!

97
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:26,519
Master!

98
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:29,399
Master! Master!

99
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:30,480
Are you okay?

100
00:05:31,519 --> 00:05:32,720
What are you doing, She-devil?

101
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:34,519
Are you trying to take advantage of me?

102
00:05:34,639 --> 00:05:35,720
I'm saving your life!

103
00:05:37,480 --> 00:05:38,600
Saving my life?

104
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:39,680
You were straddling me!

105
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:41,120
How could I save you without sitting on you?

106
00:05:42,879 --> 00:05:43,600
Ingrate!

107
00:05:46,639 --> 00:05:48,639
Dragon-Locking Well draws from this river.

108
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:50,800
Let's hurry and check downstream.

109
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:53,720
Dragon-Locking Well's water connects here.

110
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:55,560
Master, what is this place?

111
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:59,959
This pool is deep in the mountains.

112
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:01,519
It's hot and rainy,

113
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:03,000
and the air is stagnant.

114
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:04,600
In the swamp,

115
00:06:04,879 --> 00:06:06,160
a lot of rotting plants have accumulated.

116
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:08,199
The dirty water with these rotting plants

117
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:10,199
will evaporate under high temperatures,

118
00:06:10,959 --> 00:06:11,560
which then

119
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:13,240
forms miasma.

120
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:16,000
This miasma-filled water

121
00:06:16,639 --> 00:06:17,480
flows along the bottom of the well

122
00:06:18,279 --> 00:06:19,600
and into Li Mansion's Dragon-Locking Well,

123
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:22,759
filling the well with toxic miasma.

124
00:06:30,759 --> 00:06:31,360
I see.

125
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:34,160
This valve connects to the Dragon-Locking Well's chain.

126
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:38,639
But

127
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:40,240
that doesn't make sense.

128
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:41,800
Why doesn't it make sense?

129
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:45,199
Didn't we swim here from the well's bottom

130
00:06:45,879 --> 00:06:46,959
and find that the area around the pool

131
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:48,240
is filled with miasma-contaminated water?

132
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:53,279
I mean,

133
00:06:54,399 --> 00:06:55,759
why would someone channel miasma

134
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:58,199
directly into their own well water?

135
00:06:59,160 --> 00:07:00,000
You mean

136
00:07:00,959 --> 00:07:02,920
someone purposely led miasma to Li Mansion

137
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:04,079
to use it as a murder weapon?

138
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:06,519
It's very likely.

139
00:07:08,120 --> 00:07:10,120
Judging by the wear on this iron chain,

140
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:11,680
this water valve

141
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:13,480
was installed later on.

142
00:07:13,959 --> 00:07:15,079
Someone modified the water valve.

143
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:27,600
So that means

144
00:07:30,279 --> 00:07:32,160
at noon on the day of the incident,

145
00:07:33,079 --> 00:07:34,240
the miasma evaporated.

146
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:35,800
That's why Third Madam

147
00:07:36,720 --> 00:07:37,800
was infected and died.

148
00:07:40,839 --> 00:07:42,680
The killer modified Dragon-Locking Well's valve,

149
00:07:43,720 --> 00:07:44,800
diverting the sewage containing miasma

150
00:07:44,959 --> 00:07:46,040
into Li Mansion's well.

151
00:07:47,199 --> 00:07:48,240
The ventilation in the well was poor,

152
00:07:48,879 --> 00:07:50,240
and with the scorching sun that day,

153
00:07:50,399 --> 00:07:51,519
the temperature inside rose.

154
00:07:52,480 --> 00:07:53,040
The miasma

155
00:07:53,839 --> 00:07:55,360
evaporated from the sewage.

156
00:07:56,680 --> 00:07:58,399
Third Madam inhaled miasma by the well,

157
00:07:59,199 --> 00:08:00,079
and was poisoned.

158
00:08:02,360 --> 00:08:02,800
Madam!

159
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:03,959
Madam!

160
00:08:04,399 --> 00:08:05,240
Madam, what's wrong?

161
00:08:06,319 --> 00:08:06,759
Madam!

162
00:08:07,399 --> 00:08:08,399
What's wrong, Madam?

163
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:10,519
Before the incident,

164
00:08:11,519 --> 00:08:12,639
the strange noises from the well

165
00:08:13,720 --> 00:08:15,519
were made when the killer was modifying

166
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:16,439
the water channel.

167
00:08:18,279 --> 00:08:19,680
The so-called Dragon King claiming lives

168
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:21,000
was actually

169
00:08:21,639 --> 00:08:22,759
just murder by miasma.

170
00:08:24,199 --> 00:08:25,120
So that means

171
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:28,000
Third Madam was also murdered.

172
00:08:29,399 --> 00:08:30,000
She-devil,

173
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:32,519
you're the next one to marry Master Li.

174
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:33,720
How will you die?

175
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:35,399
Before I die,

176
00:08:35,519 --> 00:08:36,440
I'll take care of you first.

177
00:08:36,799 --> 00:08:37,559
Alright, alright, alright.

178
00:08:38,639 --> 00:08:39,159
Keep going.

179
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:44,600
The killer used hidden mechanisms

180
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:45,639
to kill Mengzhu,

181
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:48,799
used oleander tea

182
00:08:49,399 --> 00:08:50,240
to poison First Wife,

183
00:08:52,360 --> 00:08:53,000
used a chandelier

184
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:55,000
to crush Second Madam,

185
00:08:57,159 --> 00:08:59,360
and used miasma to kill Third Madam.

186
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:03,320
But this killer

187
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:05,120
never showed up.

188
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:06,559
Killing from a distance,

189
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:08,919
and attributing the four people's deaths

190
00:09:09,639 --> 00:09:11,440
to ghosts and monsters.

191
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:13,120
That's very strange.

192
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:14,799
Yeah.

193
00:09:16,679 --> 00:09:19,679
Now that we've cracked the killing methods

194
00:09:20,039 --> 00:09:21,039
of all four murders,

195
00:09:21,799 --> 00:09:22,879
who could the killer be?

196
00:09:25,279 --> 00:09:26,080
In my opinion,

197
00:09:28,159 --> 00:09:28,879
this killer

198
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:31,639
not only knows everyone's habits in Li Mansion,

199
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:32,519
but

200
00:09:33,080 --> 00:09:34,360
he's also skilled in architecture,

201
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:35,679
chemistry,

202
00:09:36,360 --> 00:09:37,200
and painting.

203
00:09:38,399 --> 00:09:39,600
He can make hidden mechanisms,

204
00:09:40,360 --> 00:09:42,559
and use glassware for optical experiments.

205
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:44,279
He knows herbs well

206
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:46,480
and understands plant pharmacology.

207
00:09:48,559 --> 00:09:49,480
Judging from this,

208
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:51,600
the killer is not acting alone.

209
00:09:52,320 --> 00:09:52,720
No, wait!

210
00:09:52,960 --> 00:09:53,440
Watch out!
